xplored some improvisation techniques. Why: To see the exercises from the outside and experience their expression. How: I will analyze and discuss each exercise and explain how we prepared and conducted them. -------- Preface: In March of this year we\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2012\/06\/helenarosenlund_jonashedvig_0152.jpg?fit=1200%2C797&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":401,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/11\/01\/dancers\/","url_meta":{"origin":463,"position":2},"title":"Dancers","date":"November 1, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"As stated in my project description: - Look at the possibilities for at external sources, such as the audience, a net stream, dancers, humidity, lights etc. can control the development in the music and in the video trough out a performance by using alternative sensors, controllers and programs. I want\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2013\/05\/p401.jpg?fit=1200%2C675&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":44,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/09\/13\/controllers-arduino\/","url_meta":{"origin":463,"position":3},"title":"Controllers (Arduino)","date":"September 13, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"Arduino is an i\/o-board, where you can connect a wide variety of sensors, motors, speakers etc. and make them talk with a computer. There are other similar concepts around, such as Phidgets, Eobody and Teabox. What is great with this concept is that you\u2019re not limited to a products intended\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"arduino","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2011\/09\/8.jpg?fit=600%2C600&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":35,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/09\/13\/controllers-launchpad\/","url_meta":{"origin":463,"position":4},"title":"Controllers (launchpad)","date":"September 13, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"I started with what I already had, a Launchpad from Novation. In the aspect of diversity and portability, this controller presents many advantages. You have 64 + 16 buttons (8x8)+(2x8) located at a fairly small space, and you can flip through pages which multiplies your number of buttons endlessly. You\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"launchpad","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2011\/09\/6.jpg?fit=550%2C550&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":362,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/10\/25\/project-description\/","url_meta":{"origin":463,"position":5},"title":"Project description","date":"October 25, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"Project description: Performance with realtime interaction between drums and electronics. Goal: To develop a setup with drums and electronics which shall be practical and easy to operate. Why I do this: Amongst guitarists and some what keyboard players, the integration of audio processing and the interaction between the instrument and\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"","width":0,"height":0},"classes":[]}],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/463"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=463"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/463\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1904,"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/463\/revisions\/1904"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1665"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=463"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=463"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=463"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}